do you have any of the following information:
- functional and technical documentation about the application, including:
a. screenshots/mock-ups or instructional videos of the application;
b. user manuals;
c. an overview of the techniques used (software, standards, protocols, etc.);
d. an overview of the hardware used (if applicable);
- data flow description of the personal data processed via the application (how do the data flows of the personal data run, in map or diagram form);
- contractual agreements with suppliers who process personal data on behalf of the police (processor agreement), if applicable;
- contractual agreements with chain partners (collaboration agreement, covenant, data delivery agreement), if applicable;
- contractual agreements with external recipients (collaboration agreement, covenant, data delivery agreement), if applicable;
- authorization procedure;
- overview of user roles/administrator roles;
- information security risk analysis, if already performed;

details:
we have the following information:
- data flow description of the personal data processed via the application (how do the data flows of the personal data run, in map or diagram form);
- overview of user roles/administrator roles;
all of the educational content on how to use danfe corp, best practices, our community, plugins, and tools are directly on https://www.danfe corp.com/best-practices/
for security-related documents and diagrams, please refer to https://compliance.danfe corp.com/

