given the potential risks associated, danfe corp does not permit customer audits. but danfe corp can share all third-party security audits once an nda has been signed. we cannot agree to on-site audit rights for the following reasons:
(i) the danfe corp platform relies on sub-processors providing certain service functionality. our sub-processors, particularly aws, will not permit on-site audits unless required under applicable laws;
(ii) for data protection and information security reasons, danfe corp cannot give customers a right to access systems or storage devices on which other customer data is processed or stored. because danfe corp operates exclusively on a multi-tenant basis, this effectively curtails any access to systems on which the auditing customer's data is processed; and (iii) danfe corp has several thousand customers and does not have resources available to assist with lengthy on-site audits by multiple customers.

